cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below. For reproducible work, cite a specific commit (see CITATION.md)."
title: "AI Legislation Tracker: A Curated Dataset of Global AI Laws and Governance Frameworks"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Schlangen
    given-names: Del
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-5116-9564"
repository-code: "https://github.com/delschlangen/ai-legislation-tracker"
url: "https://delschlangen.github.io/ai-legislation-tracker/"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A structured, machine-readable dataset tracking AI legislation, regulation
  and governance frameworks across US federal, US state and international
  jurisdictions. Each record carries a permanent id, a last_verified date,
  a verification level (primary, secondary or unconfirmed) and supersession
  links showing what replaced what. Includes CLI tools for querying and
  a browser interface.
keywords:
  - artificial-intelligence
  - ai-legislation
  - ai-governance
  - ai-regulation
  - ai-policy
  - eu-ai-act
  - state-ai-laws
  - technology-policy
  - dataset
  - public-policy
date-released: "2026-09-17"
